  "content": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/-HqUkTtxtoU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://link.cinderstonestudios.com/serverbanner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1198/74/prom_bisect_banner-png.png\" alt=\"Get a 25% OFF Server using code ELOCIN\" width=\"2100\" height=\"366\"></em></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://link.cinderstonestudios.com/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/badges/readthewiki.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"64\"><br></a></p>\n<h5><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/prominence/rpg/new_prominence_banner.webp?raw=true\" width=\"807\" height=\"287\"></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://link.cinderstonestudios.com/discord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1368653041145741427?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=ba743d&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://link.cinderstonestudios.com/patreon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Support us and get benefits!&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=ba743d&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"284\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://link.cinderstonestudios.com/serverbadge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Get a Server with 25%25 off&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=ba743d&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=bisecthosting&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"258\" height=\"28\"></a></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1179/306/2-webp.webp\" alt=\"Prominence features lots of custom content. Including quests, custom end game gear, and two story campaigns that unlock with the player's progression.\" width=\"1664\" height=\"876\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1179/305/1-webp.webp\" alt=\"The modpack also features a custom talent tree with 10 fates, +16 passive talents, +5 active abilities and +100 stat talents. This allows you to make your own class with a unique talent build and gear.\" width=\"1664\" height=\"968\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1179/307/3-webp.webp\" alt=\"The modpack also features a custom player leveling system, with mob scaling and multiplayer support.\" width=\"1664\" height=\"804\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1179/308/4-webp.webp\" alt=\"Prominence features a handcrafted design with custom textures on its own volcanic-like style. From simple UI changes to custom GUIs, changed textures, a custom hotbar and more! \" width=\"1664\" height=\"720\"> <img style=\"display: block;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1179/309/5-low-webp.webp\" width=\"1664\" height=\"981\"><img style=\"display: block;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1179/310/6-webp.webp\" width=\"1664\" height=\"1084\"><img style=\"display: block;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1179/334/7-webp.webp\" alt=\"Transmogrification: Choose your own style. You can &quot;transmog&quot; any item into another item, so you're able to turn into anything while keeping the same powerful gear. \" width=\"1664\" height=\"1076\"></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://link.cinderstonestudios.com/serverbanner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1198/74/prom_bisect_banner-png.png\" alt=\"Get a 25% OFF Server using code ELOCIN\" width=\"2100\" height=\"366\"></em></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>🧭 <strong>基於自訂內容打造</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>您是Vaaz的火焰之子，一個由S'kellak所創造的種族，目的是守護並維持所有領域的平衡。 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>在經歷了數千年的和平後，一股被稱為「虛無」的貪婪勢力開始入侵宇宙領域，充滿生命與死亡的世界正受到完全毀滅的威脅<strong>。</strong></strong><strong>您將如何完成使命，阻止虛無的入侵？</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>Prominence是一個基於其傳說宇宙的自訂內容所構成的模組包。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>為v4.0版本做好準備，即「Vaaz王國更新」，這在Minecraft模組包中首度呈現一個功能完善的首都城市，內含NPC，您可以在旅程中的任何時間造訪此城，並隨著任務進行而進化，最終抵達Hasturian時代。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Prominence是獨一無二的模組包，專注於平衡，同時提供豐富的RPG內容。與其他RPG模組包不同，Prominence也包含科技模組，這些是<strong>選擇性</strong>的路徑，玩家可以為了實用而採取，但仍然可以完成整個任務流程而不必觸碰科技模組。</p>\n<p><strong>為什麼要在RPG中加入科技？</strong>因為在Prominence的世界中，您是來自另一個維度、僅僅是過路的旅人，來到一個已經發展完備的世界，文明從石器時代到高技術王國均有。作為Vaaz的火焰之子，您決定開闢自己的道路。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">⭐<strong>功能概述</strong>⭐</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>📜 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>任務與劇情章節</strong></span><br>透過互動式引導您探索模組。兩大主要故事線：<strong>虛無入侵</strong>與<strong>Hasturian時代</strong>。<br>劇情章節逐步解鎖，串聯起<strong>設定</strong>、<strong>敘事</strong>與您的角色<strong>進度</strong>。</p>\n<p>🌲 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>天賦樹</strong></span><br>使用火山風格的<strong>自訂天賦樹</strong>建立自己的職業。<br>包含<strong>10種命運</strong>、<strong>16個被動天賦</strong>、<strong>5個主動技能</strong>與<strong>100個屬性天賦</strong><br>獨特的天賦與裝備來訂製您的流派。</p>\n<p>🔼 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>角色等級提升</strong></span><br>透過自訂等級系統變得更強大。<br>每升級兩點獲得<strong>天賦點數</strong>，並與隨等級成長的敵人戰鬥。<br>包含<strong>多人遊戲支援</strong>，可應對怪物難度。</p>\n<p>🎨 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>手工設計</strong></span><br>Prominence具獨特的<strong>火山視覺風格</strong>，由<strong>S'Kellak</strong>親手打造。<br>包含自訂熱槽、自訂GUI、改變的紋理，以及模組包中極多沉浸感的視覺細節。</p>\n<p>🔨 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>打造您的終期玩法</strong></span><br>憑<strong>強大的神器</strong>選擇您的玩法模式，這些神器具有獨特能力。<br>透過任務流程取得<strong>熔岩核心</strong>以鑄造神器。<br>利用<strong>熔岩殘骸</strong>獲得神器能量，透過其<strong>升級樹</strong>來升級它們。</p>\n<p>💀 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>神話挑戰 – 終期 boss 戰</strong></span><br>面對<strong>神話Boss</strong>，具有<strong>無限難度</strong>的挑戰。<br>從<strong>神話1級</strong>開始，隨機<strong>詞綴</strong>，越來越困難的boss戰<br>⚠️若您或隊友死亡，挑戰結束且<strong>虛無沙漏</strong>等級減損<br>🔓<em>在「虛無入侵」第二章完成後解鎖</em></p>\n<p>🧥 <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>幻化 – 自選風格</strong></span><br>使用魔法<strong>幻化</strong>調整您的<strong>armor</strong>與<strong>武器</strong>外觀。<br>改變任何物品的外觀而不影響其屬性；<strong>自由選擇風格，不需犧牲力量！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>以下網站是<strong>唯一</strong>托管Prominence II內容的官方網站，所有其他網站均未與我們關聯，任何聲稱其為官方網站的主張均屬謊誤。請務必避免訪問這些網站，因为它们可能含有惡意內容。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://rpg.prominence.wiki/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Prominence官方百科</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://servers.cinderstonestudios.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Prominence II官方伺服器瀏覽器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://servers.cinderstonestudios.com/create-server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Prominence II官方伺服器托管指南</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/prominence-2-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">CurseForge上Prominence官方模組頁面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/prominence-2-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Modrinth上Prominence官方模組頁面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/prominence-2-chinese\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">CurseForge上Prominence中文模組頁面</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Prominence™為Cinderstone Studios LLC的商標。此項目未獲Mojang、Microsoft或其他第三方支持或背書。所有其他商標均為各自所有者的財產。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>非官方Minecraft產品。未獲Mojang或Microsoft批准或認可。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>影片</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>英文</strong> - Hasturian Era</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F2z02O6AW4M?wmode=transparent\" width=\"637\" height=\"653\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6EstrjMAROA\" width=\"642\" height=\"374\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>英文</strong> - Void's Invasion (舊版)</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hvR-mv9wvJU\" width=\"659\" height=\"422\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>",
